   $q$Which change would best fix the order of events in the narrative?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Move sentence 7 so that it comes after sentence 14.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Move sentence 4 so that it comes before sentence 3.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"breaks-starting-sequence"},{"text":"Move sentence 2 so that it comes after sentence 14.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misplaces-setup"},{"text":"Move sentence 10 so that it comes before sentence 8.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"misplaces-event"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Move sentence 7 so that it comes after sentence 14.$q$, $q$Sentence 7 tells about the finish before Daniela even reaches the hill, so it belongs after she sees the finish line in sentence 14. Moving sentence 4 would fire the starting gun before the runners line up.$q$, 'draft', '487a96b0-9069-540a-ae60-fca433bf38ed')
