   $q$The writer wants to add this sentence to show how the letters affect the narrator: "For the first time, Giulia felt like a real person to me, not just a name on a family tree." Where should it be added?$q$, $q$[{"text":"after sentence 4","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"before-discovery"},{"text":"after sentence 1","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"before-discovery"},{"text":"after sentence 6","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"before-reading-letter"},{"text":"after sentence 11","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$after sentence 11$q$, $q$The narrator can only feel this way after reading the letters, and sentence 11 shows that long reading time ending. After sentence 6 the narrator has seen only a date, so the reaction would come too soon.$q$, 'draft', 'b8b6da68-3cce-5c31-a362-e882a6d91854')
